# Social Post
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Social — a post, liked and commented on by many users
# Case 11 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: social-follow.menata, social-like.menata, social-comment.menata

Post

Fields

- Author : User
- Caption : Rich Text
- Image : File
- Posted At : Date Time
- Like Count : Number
- Comment Count : Number

Constraints

- Caption is required.
- Image is required.

Permissions

Member

- Post

Views

- Post Form : Form
- Feed : List
- My Posts : List
- Post Detail : Detail
